* tb_post_points.cir: generated by sim/post/gen_post_decks.py from sim/r5/tb_adc5_points.cir (include line -> NETLISTS substitution; instance in INSTANCES)
* tb_adc5_points.cir -- R1 ADC revision 5 (D18): both slices, one held differential input per frame and slice.
* Frame s: slice A samples vda (SIN path) at tsA = 0.6 us + s * 22 T, slice B samples vdb (COS path) at tsA.
* vda/vdb are PWL sources written by sim/r5/run_points5.py (value of frame s applied 550 ns before its edge).
* Inputs are linear E sources around the common mode CM (R2-7). Track is high from t = 0 (revision-5 timing).
* Reference: REFLINES (ideal source, or the buffer under test fed by the r1_bgr Thevenin + noise model, see
* run_points5.py); the core has per-slice ports vrefa vrefb (MSB array) and vrefla vreflb (LSB array).
* Substitutions: CORNER TEMP VDD CM CAPLIB TIMING OPTS TMAX TSTOP PWLA PWLB REFLINES INSTANCES SAVE RAW
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib mos_ss
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerCAP.lib cap_typ
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib mos_ss
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib res_typ
.include schematic/r1_adc_r5.spice
.include sim/r5/r1_adc_timing_r5_n0_cq_vdd108_pre33.inc
.temp 125
.option reltol=1e-4 vntol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12 method=trap klu seed=1 interp

Vdd vdd 0 1.08
Vref vref 0 1.045
Vtvrefa vrefa vref 0
Vtvrefb vrefb vref 0
Vtvrefla vrefla vref 0
Vtvreflb vreflb vref 0
Vcm vcm 0 0.6
Vda vda 0 PWL(0 -0.9000000 7.883333e-07 -0.9000000 7.983333e-07 -0.9000000)
Vdb vdb 0 PWL(0 -0.8808511 7.883333e-07 -0.8808511 7.983333e-07 -0.8808511)
Esp sinp vcm vda 0 0.5
Esn sinn vcm vda 0 -0.5
Ecp cosp vcm vdb 0 0.5
Ecn cosn vcm vdb 0 -0.5
Vip isap 0 0.6
Vin isan 0 0.6

XADC sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isap isan trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 clk30 wina winb lata latb
+ stba0 stba1 stba2 stba3 stba4 stba5 stba6 stba7 stba8 stba9 stba10 stba11 stba12 stba13
+ stbb0 stbb1 stbb2 stbb3 stbb4 stbb5 stbb6 stbb7 stbb8 stbb9 stbb10 stbb11 stbb12 stbb13
+ rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vrefa vrefb vrefla vreflb 0  r1_adc5_core

.control
set num_threads=1
save v(rawa) v(rawb)
tran 1n 1.8600u 0 0.2n
write <G1_RESULTS_ROOT>/r1_adc/post-fc-ss-rec/codes.raw
.endc
.end
